101.effect:
[Fight effect]
Increases Fragment Hit Chance by 25%. Also gains one of the following effects, based on your character:
* Chodan: attacks have 25% chance of inflicting 20% of the enemy's current HP as critical damage;
* Magenta: attacks have 25% chance of generating 5 Sparks; this card deals 40 damage for each Spark gained this way (each fight starts with 0 Sparks);
* Hina: attacks have 25% chance of generating Energy, ranging from 1 to 5; at 10 Energy, this card inflicts 25% ATK as critical damage;
* Siyeon: start the combat with 250 Fury, which is then increased by 12% each turn; attacks have 25% chance of firing "Super Mega Death Rocket", inflicting damage equal to Fury; each time "Super Mega Death Rocket" is fired, Fury returns to its initial value.
[Trait bonus]
Fragment Hit Chance is increased by 30% instead if the other equipped card has an [Arcane] trait.

103.effect:
[Fight effect]
At the start of the combat, enters one of the following modes, each granting a different effect:
* Consume: each turn, recovers HP by 10% of the damage recieved, and inflicts the same amount as damage to the opponent;
* Control: attacks deal 20% ATK critical damage if the enemy's HP are above 60%;
* Scheme: attacks deal 20% ATK critical damage if the enemy's HP are below 40%;
* Bind: each turn, there is a 25% chance of inflicting Card Restriction, negating any card effects to be activated by your opponent during their next turn.
[Trait bonus]
Increases Fragment Hit Chance by 10% if the other equipped card has an [Arcane] trait.
